ressbook><name>TSUNEHARA KATSUHIKO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>UTA TAKAKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YANO TAKASHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SUZUKI, TOSHINORI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SUZUKI, TOSHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TSUNEHARA, KATSUHIKO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>UTA, TAKAKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YANO, TAKASHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A method for controlling the transmission power for a CDMA mobile communication system so as to reduce the influence of error control. The likelihood of a transmission power control signal transmitted from a radio base station is determined based on the transmission power control signal and the quality of reception, and the variation of the transmission power is found based on the likelihood, thereby controlling the transmission power of a mobile terminal based on the variation.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Cette invention concerne un procédé qui permet de gérer la puissance de transmission dans un système de communication mobile AMRC, et qui permet ainsi de réduire l'influence du traitement des erreurs. La probabilité qu'un signal de commande de puissance de transmission soit émis depuis une station de base radio est déterminée en fonction du signal de commande de puissance de transmission et de la qualité de la réception. La variation de la puissance de transmission est définie en fonction de cette probabilité, ce qui permet de gérer la puissance de transmission d'un terminal mobile en fonction de la variation.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>